                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN ZUR CODIERUNG UND DECODIERUNG MIT EINEM POLAREN CODE IN EINEM DRAHTLOSKOMMUNIKATIONSSYSTEM UND RUNDFUNKSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL ET PROCÉDÉ DE CODAGE ET DE DÉCODAGE À L'AIDE D'UN CODE POLAIRE DANS UN SYSTÈME DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL ET SYSTÈME DE DIFFUSION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">APPARATUS AND METHOD FOR ENCODING AND DECODING USING POLAR CODE IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION SYSTEM AND BROADCASTING SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method of transmitting a signal by a transmitting apparatus in a wireless communication system or a broadcasting system, and a transmitting apparatus, are provided, the method comprising:generating a bit sequence;identifying a number of a plurality of segments for performing a code block segmentation for the bit sequence based on a length of the bit sequence and a length of a rate matching output sequence;segmenting the bit sequence into the plurality of segments based on the number of the plurality of segments, wherein the number of the plurality of segments is identified based on a first threshold related to the length of the bit sequence, a second threshold related to the length of the rate matching output sequence, and a third threshold related to a maximum size of a mother code;generating coded bits by encoding the plurality of segments; andtransmitting, to a receiving apparatus, the coded bits.</p>
            </abstract>
